message: "If you use this protocol, please cite it as below."
title: "Polymorphic Decision Protocol"
abstract: >-
  A procedure for making high-uncertainty decisions with panels of AI systems,
  where consensus is discounted by input provenance, model confidence is tested
  under controlled pressure, and the human owns the weights, the stakes, and the
  exit.
